# Experiment artifacts, not source: archived listening pages carry their audio
# embedded as base64, and one such page is 11 MB of "HTML" that made GitHub
# call this a 70%-HTML repo. linguist-generated keeps them out of the language
# stats and collapses them in diffs.
crowgpt/results/** linguist-generated
# Generated pages, not hand-written HTML: an archived listening block with its
# clips embedded, and the maps the scouting experiments render from their data.
# Without this GitHub counts the repo as mostly HTML.
crowgpt/results/listening/**/*.html linguist-generated
experiments/**/*-map.html linguist-generated
experiments/**/map_template.html linguist-generated
